  "_note": "W65C22S Versatile Interface Adapter. Pin table audited against WDC W65C22S datasheet (rev 2018-10-08). DIP-40 package. Two 8-bit GPIO ports (PA0-PA7, PB0-PB7), two 16-bit timers, 8-bit shift register. 4-bit register select (RS0-RS3, pins 38-35). Bus interface: D0-D7 (pins 33-26), PHI2 (pin 25), RWB (pin 22), CS1/CS2B (pins 24/23). IRQB (pin 21, open drain). VSS=pin 1, VDD=pin 20.",
